00:15:41,958 --> 00:15:42,798
[SPEAKER_02]: Excellent.

205
00:15:42,878 --> 00:15:43,518
[SPEAKER_02]: Hey, we're all here.

206
00:15:43,699 --> 00:15:54,185
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so... Are you willing to change out of your dragon armor and let Lord Jamis take it?

207
00:15:57,046 --> 00:15:57,727
[SPEAKER_02]: Am I willing?

208
00:15:59,448 --> 00:16:00,708
[SPEAKER_00]: Begrudgingly, yes.

209
00:16:01,409 --> 00:16:01,749
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

210
00:16:03,988 --> 00:16:05,869
[SPEAKER_02]: So you change into the studded armor.

211
00:16:05,929 --> 00:16:08,289
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, I'm going to say if you're taking it, just at least have it cleaned.

212
00:16:09,310 --> 00:16:11,210
[SPEAKER_02]: He laughs at you.

213
00:16:14,872 --> 00:16:16,632
[SPEAKER_01]: I'm surprised you'd let me touch it.

214
00:16:16,652 --> 00:16:20,994
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, don't try it on.

215
00:16:21,614 --> 00:16:22,514
[SPEAKER_02]: Won't fit.

216
00:16:22,634 --> 00:16:24,695
[SPEAKER_00]: I'll have it cleaned if you promise to take a bath.

217
00:16:27,136 --> 00:16:30,097
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, I'll see what the wenches can do.

218
00:16:34,504 --> 00:16:36,065
[SPEAKER_02]: Anything else you need from me, Jamis?

219
00:16:39,328 --> 00:16:39,608
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

220
00:16:40,049 --> 00:16:41,370
[SPEAKER_00]: Just keep your eyes open.

221
00:16:41,470 --> 00:16:45,313
[SPEAKER_00]: I want to know if there's anything strange that has occurred around Helm Island.

222
00:16:49,136 --> 00:16:50,878
[SPEAKER_00]: Look for signs.

223
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:54,861
[SPEAKER_00]: I'll say no more.

224
00:16:55,962 --> 00:17:01,326
[SPEAKER_00]: Just use your powers of observation to make sure that

225
00:17:09,373 --> 00:17:10,814
[SPEAKER_00]: Everything is as it should be.

226
00:17:10,854 --> 00:17:12,735
[SPEAKER_00]: You know Helm Island as well as anyone.

227
00:17:13,796 --> 00:17:15,317
[SPEAKER_00]: You've walked the coastline.

228
00:17:15,337 --> 00:17:16,477
[SPEAKER_00]: You've seen the signs there.

229
00:17:16,557 --> 00:17:18,318
[SPEAKER_00]: Make sure there's nothing strange there.

230
00:17:18,378 --> 00:17:19,479
[SPEAKER_00]: That's what I wish from you.

231
00:17:20,259 --> 00:17:21,840
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm afraid there is more influence.

232
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:25,802
[SPEAKER_00]: If it's just Fairwind, that's one thing.

233
00:17:26,022 --> 00:17:27,203
[SPEAKER_00]: We can deal with him that way.

234
00:17:27,683 --> 00:17:34,067
[SPEAKER_00]: If there's something else occurring, something associated with the Toli, I wish to know that as well.

235
00:17:34,687 --> 00:17:36,368
[SPEAKER_01]: Keep my eyes and ears open.

236
00:17:44,405 --> 00:17:54,030
[SPEAKER_01]: What are we going to call him if he's going to be under disguise for the ship?

237
00:17:54,110 --> 00:17:56,812
[SPEAKER_00]: I'll let him pick a name, or you can pick a name for him now you wish.

238
00:17:57,032 --> 00:17:58,493
[SPEAKER_00]: That's your backstory.

239
00:18:00,134 --> 00:18:02,615
[SPEAKER_02]: Aristotle is my name.

240
00:18:03,115 --> 00:18:04,136
[SPEAKER_02]: That's going way back.

241
00:18:04,276 --> 00:18:05,577
[SPEAKER_02]: Yes, that is going way back.

242
00:18:06,717 --> 00:18:07,538
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, sounds good.

243
00:18:10,024 --> 00:18:11,204
[SPEAKER_00]: All right, meet the ship.

244
00:18:11,505 --> 00:18:12,705
[SPEAKER_00]: It's leaving in 20 minutes.

245
00:18:12,865 --> 00:18:14,025
[SPEAKER_00]: It's out at the Royal Docks.

246
00:18:14,806 --> 00:18:15,366
[SPEAKER_00]: You know the way.

247
00:18:16,746 --> 00:18:20,108
[SPEAKER_02]: We've got to stop by the tavern before we go.

248
00:18:22,268 --> 00:18:25,429
[SPEAKER_02]: I'll only need five minutes there, but I'll be at the dock.

249
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:29,551
[SPEAKER_02]: Okay, so you go directly to the dock.

250
00:18:31,299 --> 00:18:32,440
[SPEAKER_02]: And you've got something to do.

251
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,402
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm going to go pick up a couple flasks.

252
00:18:34,882 --> 00:18:35,102
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

253
00:18:35,302 --> 00:18:40,527
[SPEAKER_00]: So you go to the bar, and actually there's one right outside Jamis' place.

254
00:18:40,547 --> 00:18:41,748
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm sure I know them all well.

255
00:18:42,068 --> 00:18:43,529
[SPEAKER_00]: You know them all well, exactly.

256
00:18:44,490 --> 00:18:45,891
[SPEAKER_00]: This is out on the Harbor District.

257
00:18:46,432 --> 00:18:51,416
[SPEAKER_02]: So you go down and... Two flasks of red eye, put it on my tab, I'm in a hurry.

258
00:18:55,016 --> 00:18:58,298
[SPEAKER_00]: All right, the two of you walk down to the Royal Docks.

259
00:18:58,318 --> 00:19:07,565
[SPEAKER_00]: You see a coser that's in the process of being loaded with Marines, like a battalion of Marines, ready for battle.

260
00:19:07,785 --> 00:19:11,147
[SPEAKER_00]: So it's not like this is just nobody doing anything.

261
00:19:11,388 --> 00:19:19,033
[SPEAKER_00]: It's like Jamis has convinced Jeon not to just send a small mail ship out there to do what they're about to do.

262
00:19:19,053 --> 00:19:19,333
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

263
00:19:20,134 --> 00:19:20,354
[SPEAKER_00]: All right.

